@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, orm
+    :tickets: 6812
+
+    Fixed issue where the unit of work would internally use a 2.0-deprecated
+    SQL expression form, emitting a deprecation warning when SQLALCHEMY_WARN_20
+    were enabled.
+
